      "condition": "Member 0 is well-formed; member 1's alias value carries a query, which no reference spelling admits under the local-ID grammar, so it is no reference shape at all. That is decidable from the request text: the carrier is rejected whole before member 0 starts, nothing executes, and no key is claimed.",
